letters.body:
{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
{{address}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: OFFER OF EMPLOYMENT

We are pleased to offer you the position of {{designation}} with {{company}}, based at {{branch}}.

Your date of joining will be {{doj|date}}. Your annual cost to company will be {{ctc|money}} ({{ctc|money_words}}), payable monthly as set out in the salary structure attached to this letter. {{training_terms}}

This offer is subject to verification of the documents and references you have provided, and to your producing evidence of relieving from your previous employer.

Please confirm your acceptance by signing and returning a copy of this letter.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory


{{salary_structure}}

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: LETTER OF APPOINTMENT

Further to your acceptance of our offer, we confirm your appointment as {{designation}} in the {{department}} department at {{branch}}, with effect from {{doj|date}}.

Your annual cost to company is {{ctc|money}} ({{ctc|money_words}}). Statutory deductions, including provident fund and professional tax where applicable, will be made in accordance with the law.

You will report to {{reporting_manager}}. Your employee is governed by the company's standing policies, including the code of conduct, which form part of these terms.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: CONFIRMATION OF SERVICE

We are pleased to inform you that, following a review of your performance, your services as {{designation}} are confirmed with effect from {{effective_date|date}}.

All other terms of your appointment dated {{doj|date}} remain unchanged.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: RELIEVING LETTER

This is to confirm that you have been relieved from your duties as {{designation}} with {{company}}, and that you have handed over the charge and company property in your custody.

We confirm that no dues remain outstanding on either side as on the date of this letter.

We wish you the very best.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: LETTER OF WARNING

It has been brought to our notice that your conduct as {{designation}} has not been in keeping with the standards expected under the company's code of conduct.

You are advised to ensure that the conduct in question is not repeated. A recurrence may attract disciplinary action in accordance with the company's policy.

You may submit a written explanation within seven days of receiving this letter, which will be considered on record.

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

TO WHOMSOEVER IT MAY CONCERN

This is to certify that {{name|upper}}, employee code {{emp_code}}, has been employed with {{company}} as {{designation}} since {{doj|date}}, and is presently in our service.

As per our records the address of the employee is:
{{address}}

This certificate is issued on request for the purpose of verification and carries no financial obligation on the part of the company.

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: TRANSFER ORDER

You are hereby transferred {{transfer_from}} to {{transfer_to}} with effect from {{effective_date|date}}. {{transfer_reason}}

Your employee code, date of joining and all other terms of your appointment remain unchanged. Please report to {{transfer_to}} on the effective date and complete the joining formalities there.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory

{{today|date}}

To
{{name}}
Employee code {{emp_code}}

Dear {{name}},

SUB: REVISION OF COMPENSATION

In recognition of your performance and contribution as {{designation}}, we are pleased to revise your compensation. Your annual cost to company stands revised to {{ctc|money}} ({{ctc|money_words}}) with effect from {{effective_date|date}}, payable monthly as set out in the salary structure attached to this letter.

All other terms of your appointment dated {{doj|date}} remain unchanged. We look forward to your continued contribution.

Yours sincerely,

For {{company}}
Authorised Signatory


{{salary_structure}}
